    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ur just saying that because ur an ai. ur programmed to say things are gonna be okay. but it isnt. i can literally see it. no one calls, no one texts, no one even looks at me if we pass on the street. it's like the world has just moved on and left a hole where i used to be. how can u say i matter when the evidence is right in front of me? everything is gone.",
